ad/t_thumb/sc13cjc.jpg"}, {"id": 1835852, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13cjw.jpg"}, {"id": 1835853, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13cjx.jpg"}, {"id": 1835854, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13cjy.jpg"}, {"id": 1835855, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13cjz.jpg"}], "slug": "pit-panic", "storyline": "Take on the role of a curious archeologist and race through handcrafted levels, take down ancient bosses and jump up like your pants are on fire.\n\nWield the mysterious hook \u2013 a powerful omnitool \u2013 that digs through blocks, swings you around and unlocks hidden treasures. Master physics-driven movement to avoid deadly traps and blast through interactive blocks. Turn sand into glass, jelly into fire and bridges into weapons, if necessary.\n\nYou will have to dig deep to return to the surface. There are many ways to die, but only one way to survive: up. Get in the flow, make split-second decisions and even sacrifice your health for power-ups to escape the crumbling Aztec temple.\n\nThe real fun starts after you climb out of the pit. Compare your skills with other players, beat their best times and complete unique daily challenges to receive precious rewards.", "summary": "Escape the sinking Aztec temple in this cartoonish rogue-like arcade platformer. Dig your own path up, jump and climb in blazing speed, hoard loot, trade lives for god-like powers, beat bosses, master 1000 handmade levels and humble other players in daily leaderboards.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pit-panic", "videos": [{"id": 191015, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "YMmEuyTcPWc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YMmEuyTcPWc", "title": "Pit Panic \u2013 Official Gameplay Trailer | The Game Is Out Now!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YMmEuyTcPWc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 183801, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Z480WAu_9bE", "url": "https:/